tion estimates.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Extrapolating from the 1,267 WNV neuroinvasive disease cases reported, an estimated 38,000–88,500 nonneuroinvasive disease cases might have occurred in 2013.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}